                "Substantive Procedure 1: Five-Step Contract Allocation and Unbilled Assets Audit: The audit team extracts 45 multi-element bundled enterprise contracts executed during Q4 representing $420M in total contract value. Each contract bundles hardware server appliances, multi-year cloud SaaS licenses, and 24/7 technical implementation support. The audit team recalculates management's relative SSP allocation models against historical standalone sales data. Testing reveals that management overstated hardware revenue recognized upfront at shipment by under-allocating $6,800,000 of transaction consideration to the multi-year cloud SaaS service obligations. This $6.8M should have been deferred as unearned contract liabilities rather than recognized immediately in Q4 operating revenues.",
